# Frontend configuration (public values only: everything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the browser).
# Leave empty in development: the Vite dev server proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
# In production set the full URL of the deployed backend API, e.g. https://nexus-api.example.org/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# Database URLs, SECRET_KEY and passwords belong ONLY in backend/.env, never here.
